===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:demayne<ety:bor<fro:demaine<id:domain>>>|tree=+}}
From {{inh|en|enm|demayne}}, {{m|enm|demain||rule}}, from {{der|en|fro|demeine}}, {{m|fro|demaine}}, {{m|fro|demeigne}}, {{m|fro|domaine||power}}, ({{cog|fr|domaine}}), from {{der|en|la|dominium||property, right of ownership}}, from {{m|la|dominus||master, proprietor, owner}}. {{doublet|en|demesne|dominium}}, and closely related to {{m|en|dominion}} and {{m|en|domino}}. See also {{m|en|dame}}, and compare {{m|en|demain}}, {{m|en|danger}}, {{m|en|dungeon}}.

